    "Description": "A transparency slide that shows a detail of the left hind quarter and saddle of a carousel pig. It is very worn. The saddle is light brown, dark brown, and yellow. The saddle blanket is green and red with a yellow floral design. The tack is red with a muted clasp design. The skin of the pig ranges from a light tan to black. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16B” at the top and “S.S. RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 8.5.81” at the bottom.",
